com", "date": "2021-01-26T16:25:20Z"}, "message": "[skip pipeline] PDO-1576 add more granular control on all PingCloud base products\n\n- Restructured base k8s configurations to be more granular by product.\n  Split PA, PA-WAS, and PF runtime and admin into separate folders.\n- Restructured prod/x-small,small,medium,large and test to support new base strcture.\n- Made remove-from-secondary-patch.yaml into serveral files by product. Moved each configuration to its proper folder in templates ping-cloud\n- add K8S_GIT_BRANCH_UPGRADE environment variable to support product upgrades\n- add 'base' endpoint to common pingcloud resources within code-gen/templates\n- fix bug with ARGOCD_PUBLIC_HOSTNAME by adding = within env_vars code-gen/templates", "tree": {"sha": "2f3f2fd07e975764b42a106dc531ffa8fa521752", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pingidentity/ping-cloud-base/git/trees/2f3f2fd07e975764b42a106dc531ffa8fa521752"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pingidentity/ping-cloud-base/git/commits/ff61cbf5f1af6b38c3ca247f81d7bc27e39195bc", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pingidentity/ping-cloud-base/commits/ff61cbf5f1af6b38c3ca247f81d7bc27e39195bc", "html_url": "https://github.com/pingidentity/ping-cloud-base/commit/ff61cbf5f1af6b38c3ca247f81d7bc27e39195bc", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/pingidentity/ping-cloud-base/commits/ff61cbf5f1af6b38c3ca247f81d7bc27e39195bc/comments", "author": {"login": "calvincarter-ping", "id": 54998922, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTk4OTIy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54998922?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/calvincarter-ping", "html_url": "https://github.com/calvincarter-ping", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/calvincarter-ping/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/calvincarter-ping/following{/othe